                <pb facs="0632" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg526"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister O’Brien.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Pharaphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-08"><hi rendition="#italic">February 8,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root notifies Mr. O’Brien that he is to be the President’s representative at
                    the King’s funeral. Instructs him to notify the foreign office accordingly.)</p>
            </div>
